Though non-minion Angels have a few oddities; C343-122 refers.

> 	It may be (probably is) the case that angels that are created as
> minions are untameable, but normal randomly generated ones can certainly
> be tamed. Possibly the wizmode interface is assuming that they should be
> minions?

Yes (well, the general wishing interface, not necessarily wizmode).

  /* some creatures have special data structures that only make sense
   * in their normal locations -- if the player tries to create one
   * elsewhere, or to revive one, the disoriented creature becomes a
   * zombie
   */

The DevTeam are aware of the peculiarities involved in the different
means of Angel creation; a general fix is apparently "awfully messy
and may take a while", though.

